 "semantic_notes": [
  "Integrated errors are literal sampleVariance magnitudes of nine cyclic subsamples, not square roots or a covariance matrix.",
  "vnTwoDiff calculates bootstrap errors but calls the no-error fillScatter overload: native y-error bars are zero, not proof of zero uncertainty.",
  "Native NaN central values are replaced by zero by fillScatter; a serialized zero cannot distinguish that branch from a physical zero.",
  "rawHookOut stores synthetic profile DBNs, not ordinary profile samples; its reference bin(0) is overwritten by the j=0 loop. Raw profiles do not establish recoverable reference or calibrated variance.",
  "CMS analyze fills ECorr with default weight 1.0, not an explicit event-weight argument. Per-weight ECorr behavior and normalization must be observed in a separate native qualification.",
  "No area, width, cross-section scaling, Poissonization, group independence or covariance is inferred; all points and native flow/masked states remain."
